---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout
  title="私たちについて | 株式会社ロウリュ研究所 採用サイト"
  description="ロウリュ研究所の5つの研究棟と、大事にしていることを紹介します。"
>
  <div class="container">
    <header class="page-head">
      <h1 class="page-head__title">私たちについて</h1>
      <p class="page-head__lead">
        温度と湿度と休憩の組み合わせを、毎日まじめに試している会社です。
      </p>
    </header>
    <picture>
      <source
        type="image/avif"
        srcset="
              /images/band-about-640.avif   640w,
              /images/band-about-1280.avif 1280w
            "
        sizes="(min-width: 72rem) 68rem, 100vw"
      />
      <source
        type="image/webp"
        srcset="
              /images/band-about-640.webp   640w,
              /images/band-about-1280.webp 1280w
            "
        sizes="(min-width: 72rem) 68rem, 100vw"
      />
      <img
        class="photo-band"
        src="/images/band-about-1280.jpg"
        srcset="
              /images/band-about-640.jpg   640w,
              /images/band-about-1280.jpg 1280w
            "
        sizes="(min-width: 72rem) 68rem, 100vw"
        width="1920"
        height="1440"
        alt="雪の中に建つ、木とガラスの小さなサウナ小屋"
        loading="eager"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </picture>

    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="section__title">5つの研究棟</h2>
      <ul class="lab-list">
        <li class="lab-list__item">
          <picture>
            <source
              type="image/avif"
              srcset="
                    /images/lab-kanda-640.avif   640w,
                    /images/lab-kanda-1280.avif 1280w
                  "
              sizes="(min-width: 72rem) 22rem, (min-width: 48em) 33vw, 100vw"
            />
            <source
              type="image/webp"
              srcset="
                    /images/lab-kanda-640.webp   640w,
                    /images/lab-kanda-1280.webp 1280w
                  "
              sizes="(min-width: 72rem) 22rem, (min-width: 48em) 33vw, 100vw"
            />
            <img
              class="lab-list__image"
              src="/images/lab-kanda-1280.jpg"
              srcset="
                    /images/lab-kanda-640.jpg   640w,
                    /images/lab-kanda-1280.jpg 1280w
                  "
              sizes="(min-width: 72rem) 22rem, (min-width: 48em) 33vw, 100vw"
              width="1920"
              height="1280"
              alt="サウナストーンを積んだストーブのある、木のサウナ室"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </picture>
          <h3 class="lab-list__name">神田研究棟</h3>
          <p class="lab-list__text">
            最初の研究棟。サウナ室は92℃、いちばん熱い
          </p>
        </li>
        <li class="lab-list__item">
          <picture>
            <source
              type="image/avif"
              srcset="
                    /images/lab-nakano-640.avif   640w,
                    /images/lab-nakano-1280.avif 1280w
                  "
              sizes="(min-width: 72rem) 22rem, (min-width: 48em) 33vw, 100vw"
            />
            <source
              type="image/webp"
              srcset="
                    /images/lab-nakano-640.webp   640w,
                    /images/lab-nakano-1280.webp 1280w
                  "
              sizes="(min-width: 72rem) 22rem, (min-width: 48em) 33vw, 100vw"
            />
            <img
              class="lab-list__image"
              src="/images/lab-nakano-1280.jpg"
              srcset="
                    /images/lab-nakano-640.jpg   640w,
                    /images/lab-nakano-1280.jpg 1280w
                  "
              sizes="(min-width: 72rem) 22rem, (min-width: 48em) 33vw, 100vw"
              width="1920"
              height="1133"
              alt="煙突から煙が上がる、森の中のサウナ小屋"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </picture>
          <h3 class="lab-list__name">中野研究棟</h3>
          <p class="lab-list__text">薪ストーブのサウナがある</p>
        </li>
        <li class="lab-list__item">
          <picture>
            <source
              type="image/avif"
              srcset="
                    /images/lab-yokohama-640.avif   640w,
                    /images/lab-yokohama-1280.avif 1280w
                  "
              sizes="(min-width: 72rem) 22rem, (min-width: 48em) 33vw, 100vw"
            />
            <source
              type="image/webp"
              srcset="
                    /images/lab-yokohama-640.webp   640w,
                    /images/lab-yokohama-1280.webp 1280w
                  "
              sizes="(min-width: 72rem) 22rem, (min-width: 48em) 33vw, 100vw"
            />
            <img
              class="lab-list__image"
              src="/images/lab-yokohama-1280.jpg"
              srcset="
                    /images/lab-yokohama-640.jpg   640w,
                    /images/lab-yokohama-1280.jpg 1280w
                  "
              sizes="(min-width: 72rem) 22rem, (min-width: 48em) 33vw, 100vw"
              width="1536"
              height="1920"
              alt="海辺の岩場に建つサウナ小屋"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </picture>
          <h3 class="lab-list__name">横浜研究棟</h3>
          <p class="lab-list__text">海風で外気浴ができる</p>
        </li>
        <li class="lab-list__item">
          <picture>
            <source
              type="image/avif"
              srcset="
                    /images/lab-omiya-640.avif   640w,
                    /images/lab-omiya-1280.avif 1280w
                  "
              sizes="(min-width: 72rem) 22rem, (min-width: 48em) 33vw, 100vw"
            />
            <source
              type="image/webp"
              srcset="
                    /images/lab-omiya-640.webp   640w,
                    /images/lab-omiya-1280.webp 1280w
                  "
              sizes="(min-width: 72rem) 22rem, (min-width: 48em) 33vw, 100vw"
            />
            <img
              class="lab-list__image"
              src="/images/lab-omiya-1280.jpg"
              srcset="
                    /images/lab-omiya-640.jpg   640w,
                    /images/lab-omiya-1280.jpg 1280w
                  "
              sizes="(min-width: 72rem) 22rem, (min-width: 48em) 33vw, 100vw"
              width="1920"
              height="1440"
              alt="真上から見た、石張りの水風呂"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </picture>
          <h3 class="lab-list__name">大宮研究棟</h3>
          <p class="lab-list__text">水風呂が3つ。13℃、16℃、20℃</p>
        </li>
        <li class="lab-list__item">
          <picture>
            <source
              type="image/avif"
              srcset="
                    /images/lab-kohan-640.avif   640w,
                    /images/lab-kohan-1280.avif 1280w
                  "
              sizes="(min-width: 72rem) 22rem, (min-width: 48em) 33vw, 100vw"
            />
            <source
              type="image/webp"
              srcset="
                    /images/lab-kohan-640.webp   640w,
                    /images/lab-kohan-1280.webp 1280w
                  "
              sizes="(min-width: 72rem) 22rem, (min-width: 48em) 33vw, 100vw"
            />
            <img
              class="lab-list__image"
              src="/images/lab-kohan-1280.jpg"
              srcset="
                    /images/lab-kohan-640.jpg   640w,
                    /images/lab-kohan-1280.jpg 1280w
                  "
              sizes="(min-width: 72rem) 22rem, (min-width: 48em) 33vw, 100vw"
              width="1920"
              height="1280"
              alt="湖のほとりに置いた樽型のサウナ"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </picture>
          <h3 class="lab-list__name">湖畔研究棟</h3>
          <p class="lab-list__text">テントサウナの拠点。湖が水風呂</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2 class="section__title">大事にしていること</h2>
      <div class="section__body">
        <p>
          熱さを競わないこと。お客さまがいちばん気持ちよく出られる温度を、研究棟ごとに探し続けています。
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <section class="container">
    <div class="apply-cta">
      <p class="apply-cta__text">
        まずは一度、研究棟の空気を吸いに来てください。
      </p>
      <a class="button" href="/process/">
        応募する
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
